2026-10-09T00:54:59.8224887Z E           - paragraph: When applying for accommodation through Espacil Habitat, please quote the partner code PAR963531 .
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8225814Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8226304Z E           - group: 再看 1 則資料
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8226765Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8227363Z E           - paragraph: 先確認交換生住宿資格，再把交通與餐食納入預算。
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8245474Z E           - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8246033Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8246453Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8246998Z E           - heading "每月生活預算" [level=3]
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8247846Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8249412Z E           - paragraph: It can make everyday life much easier, especially when paying rent, receiving housing support, managing subscriptions and completing administrative procedures.
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8250756Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8251221Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8252165Z E           - paragraph: "Rent: €590/month for a 17 m² studio; €610/month for a 21 m² studio."
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8252883Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8253297Z E           - group: 再看 1 則資料
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8253743Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8254079Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8254541Z E           - heading "飲食與採買" [level=3]
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8255048Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8256680Z E           - paragraph: It offers a high quality of life, a lively cultural calendar, plenty of cafés and restaurants, and easy access to Brittany’s coastline and countryside.
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8258390Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8258852Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8259788Z E           - paragraph: Bed linen, kitchen utensils, crockery, and cooking equipment must be provided by the students.
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8260635Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8261035Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8261651Z E           - paragraph: 可將這些地點列為用餐與採買候選，再比對上課校區及宿舍位置。
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8262211Z E           - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8262648Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8263045Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8263551Z E           - heading "交通與地點" [level=3]
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8264059Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8265413Z E           - paragraph: The Paris campus is located at 9 rue d’Athènes, 75009 Paris , in the heart of the capital, close to Saint-Lazare station.
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8266366Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8266796Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8269853Z E           - paragraph: "The campus is also well connected to Rennes city centre via the STAR public transport network : Pontchaillou metro station is approximately a 10-minute walk away, with bus routes and cycle paths also easily accessible."
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8271621Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8272173Z E           - group: 再看 1 則資料
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8272666Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8273355Z E           - paragraph: 可比較住宿到上述站點的路線，評估通勤選擇。
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8273905Z E           - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8274597Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8274978Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8275494Z E           - heading "課業與教學" [level=3]
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8276030Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8278070Z E           - paragraph: The Rennes campus is located around 10 minutes from the city centre and brings together teaching buildings, student facilities, sports areas and green spaces in a dynamic international environment.
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8279755Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8280261Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8280672Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8281245Z E           - heading "校園活動與社交" [level=3]
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8281813Z E           - text: 官方 · 機器翻譯
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8284156Z E           - paragraph: 雷恩 SB 交換生須來自合作校、仍具母校學位生身分並先由母校提名；2026/27 秋季提名 5 月 10 日、申請 5 月 20 日，2027年春季 提名 10 月 10 日、申請 10 月 20 日。等級 2 至 5 依已修商管 ECTS 分流，課程為英語並要求 B2。現行 傳入的 頁寫 等級 2 只開秋季，但 2026/27 交換資訊表 的春季日程又列 Levels 2、4、5，兩個官方來源不一致，不能自行判定 等級 2 春季可申請；必須由長庚提名信或 雷恩 SB 交換辦公室 確認。
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8285580Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8286038Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8286424Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8286974Z E           - heading "安全、醫療與保險" [level=3]
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8287942Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8289874Z E           - paragraph: Before signing a rental contract, make sure you understand the main administrative requirements for renting accommodation in France, including deposits, guarantors, insurance and supporting documents.
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8291828Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8292306Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8294190Z E           - paragraph: "Service charge package: €95/month (including water, electricity, home insurance, household waste tax, Wi-Fi, and access to the fitness room and coworking spaces)."
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8295633Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8296140Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8296833Z E           - paragraph: 可先查詢上述健康服務；接診、語言與保險適用性仍須確認。
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8297659Z E           - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8298168Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8298558Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8299079Z E           - heading "文化適應與交朋友" [level=3]
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8299587Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8301124Z E           - paragraph: Rennes is one of France’s most student-friendly cities, with a lively cultural scene, a welcoming atmosphere and easy access to the Breton coast.
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8302282Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8302706Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8303066Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8303570Z E           - heading "旅行與周邊城市" [level=3]
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8304090Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T00:54:59.8305878Z E           - paragraph: If you are studying on the Paris campus, you can reach central Paris easily from the city’s airports and train stations using public transport, taxis or airport transfer services.
