2026-10-09T01:07:01.8610192Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8610380Z E           - heading "每月生活預算" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8610523Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8611273Z E           - paragraph: It can make everyday life much easier, especially when paying rent, receiving housing support, managing subscriptions and completing administrative procedures.
