2026-10-09T01:07:06.8458297Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8459227Z         - paragraph: Some hotels offer our students special rates and are close to bus stops and the campus, such as Mercure Lourdes, Ramada Lourdes, Mercure Savassi, Novotel Savassi, Ibis Budget Savassi and Royal Golden Savassi.
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8459346Z         - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8459470Z         - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:06.8460322Z         - paragraph: While most students prefer biking or walking around campus, the GoRaleigh bus system and NC State’s Wolfline provide free or low-cost transportation to popular areas around the city.
